# One Last Job's third mode returning Loxodon Warhammer (CR 301.5e, 303.4f): nothing is targeted but the card; the creature it is
# attached to is chosen as the mode resolves among all the creatures Bot1 controls it could equip (an Equipment has no colour, so the
# Black Knight's protection from white does not matter, CR 702.16c). Bot1 controls Savannah Lions and Black Knight and chooses the
# Knight, not the first creature offered: the Knight is 5/2 (2/2 and +3/+0, CR 613.4c) and the Lions stay 2/1.

